@startuml
' Palette: sequence; based on the Visual Paradigm guide samples (see README).
' Interaction: Xử lý và lập chỉ mục tài liệu
skinparam defaultFontColor #111111
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
skinparam ActorBorderColor #222222
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9D9
skinparam NoteBorderColor #555555
skinparam RectangleBackgroundColor white
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #222222
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #222222
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #222222
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
skinparam SequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor white
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #222222
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 40
hide footbox
autonumber
autoactivate on
actor "Student / Teacher" as User
participant ":Web" as Web
participant ":Java" as Java
participant ":Python job API / worker" as AI
participant ":Object Storage" as Storage
participant ":pgvector (ai)" as DB
User -> Web : Upload Personal PDF / Teacher PPTX
Web -> Java : Multipart upload
Java -> Java : Xác thực owner, định dạng và dung lượng
Java -> Storage : Lưu tệp riêng tư
Java -> AI : /documents/index (signed URL, scope, idempotency)
AI --> Java : 202 {jobId, status}
Java --> Web : Document đang xử lý
AI -> Storage : Đọc tệp bằng quyền tạm
AI -> AI : Parse theo trang/slide; chunk + embedding
AI -> DB : Lưu index/version/chunks idempotent
opt Teacher PPTX
AI -> Storage : Lưu slide artifacts
end
loop Poll job có backoff
Java -> AI : GET /jobs/{jobId}
AI --> Java : Status / safe error / artifact metadata
end
Java -> Java : READY + metadata hoặc FAILED
Web -> Java : Poll document status
Java --> Web : Trạng thái và metadata an toàn
return Hoàn tất xử lý
note over User,Java
Personal PDF: tối đa 20 MB, phải có text layer.
Teacher PPTX: tối đa 50 MB, READY chưa tự public.
Teacher PDF: chỉ lưu/tải; không đi qua pipeline AI.
end note
@enduml
